Conflicts: slskd
Description: slskdN, an unofficial batteries-included fork of slskd
 Decentralized pods, content validation, swarm downloads, DHT mesh networking,
 auto-replace, wishlist, security hardening. Modern web UI for the Soulseek
 network.
 .
 Stable Features: Auto-replace stuck downloads, wishlist/background search,
 smart source ranking, tabbed browsing, user notes & ratings, push notifications,
 multi-select folder downloads, advanced search filters, PWA/mobile support,
 delete files on disk, block users, save filters, chat improvements, multi-source
 swarm downloads, DHT mesh networking with TLS, CSRF protection & security
 hardening.
 .
 Advanced Features: Decentralized pod communities, Byzantine consensus &
 proof-of-storage content validation, MusicBrainz integration, service fabric.
 .
 Unofficial fork of slskd. Drop-in replacement for slskd, preserves existing
 configuration.
